+
+**Version.** This candidate targets **0.9.0**. The version-of-truth files
+(`package.json`, `src-tauri/Cargo.toml`, `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`,
+`sidecar/app.py` `FastAPI(version=...)`, `HOST_VERSION` in
